BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dry January (Tørrlagt januar)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260201
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-dry-january-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Dry January (Tørrlagt januar)\n\nInternational campaign month
 \, widely picked up in Norway. No Norwegian owner. Remember that alcohol a
 dvertising is banned in Norway (the Alcohol Act\, alkoholloven § 9-2)\; a
 lcohol-free variants need care not to promote the parent brand.\n\nSource:
  https://alcoholchange.org.uk/get-involved/campaigns/dry-january
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://alcoholchange.org.uk/get-involved/campaigns/dry-january
END:VEVENT
