CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Dates vary by municipality (kommune) — this is the national 
 range. Check the local school calendar (skolerute).\n\nEaster school break
  (Påskeferie)\n\nSchools close from the Monday before Maundy Thursday thr
 ough Easter Monday\; some municipalities (kommuner) add the Tuesday. Range
  shown: Saturday before Palm Sunday to Easter Tuesday. Peak cabin and moun
 tain season.\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
