BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Russ celebration season (Russetiden)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260420
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260518
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-russetid-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Russ celebration season (Russetiden)\n\nTraditionally ~20 Apri
 l to 17. mai for final-year upper-secondary students (russ). No legal date
 s. The Government aims to move the celebration after exams and from 2026 s
 preads final-year (vg3) written exams either side of 17. mai — expect th
 is window to shift\; re-check each year. Marketing to russ involves minors
 : avoid alcohol and pressure tactics.\n\nSource: https://www.regjeringen.n
 o/no/aktuelt/regjeringen-skal-endre-russetiden/id3030864/
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.regjeringen.no/no/aktuelt/regjeringen-skal-endre-russetide
 n/id3030864/
END:VEVENT
