DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-skoleslutt-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Dates vary by municipality (kommune) — this is the national 
 range. Check the local school calendar (skolerute).\n\nLast day of school 
 (Skoleslutt)\n\nSet in each municipality's school calendar (skolerute\; op
 plæringslova § 14-1)\; usually a weekday between ~17 and 24 June. Oslo's
  last day was Fri 18 June 2027 and is Thu 22 June 2028 — no stable weekd
 ay rule\, so a range.\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-0
 6-09-30
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
