BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Collective summer holiday (Fellesferie)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260706
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260725
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-fellesferie-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Collective summer holiday (Fellesferie)\n\nTraditionally ISO w
 eeks 28–30 in July\, recommended by NHO (the Confederation of Norwegian 
 Enterprise) and Fellesforbundet (the United Federation of Trade Unions) fo
 r industry (6–24 July in 2026). The Holidays Act (ferieloven) § 5 lets 
 employees claim 3 weeks' main holiday between 1 June and 30 September (htt
 ps://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/1988-04-29-21). B2B goes quiet\; travel\, 
 grilling and cabin peak.\n\nSource: https://www.thelocal.no/20210702/felle
 sferie-everything-you-need-to-know-about-norways-collective-holiday-period
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.thelocal.no/20210702/fellesferie-everything-you-need-to-kn
 ow-about-norways-collective-holiday-period
END:VEVENT
