BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Back to school (Skolestart) (varies locally)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260810
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260822
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-skolestart-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Dates vary by municipality (kommune) — this is the national 
 range. Check the local school calendar (skolerute).\n\nBack to school (Sko
 lestart)\n\nFirst school day is set locally\, usually mid-August (ISO week
  33 or 34) — Bergen even varies the weekday (Fri 14 Aug 2026\, Mon 16 Au
 g 2027)\, so it keeps the national range. Back-to-school is also the autum
 n restart ("høstoppstart") for B2B: offices fill up again after the colle
 ctive summer holiday (fellesferie).\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no/dokument
 /NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
END:VEVENT
