DESCRIPTION:Dates vary by municipality (kommune) — this is the national 
 range. Check the local school calendar (skolerute).\n\nAutumn school break
  (Høstferie)\n\nOne school week in ISO week 40 or 41\, set locally (e.g. 
 Oslo and Bærum week 40\; Trondheim\, Haugesund and Nord-Aurdal week 41 in
  2026). The national entry spans both weeks.\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no
 /dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
