 week — commonly Monday of Black Friday week through Cyber Monday. Many s
 tart earlier ("Black November")\; treat the start as the latest safe go-li
 ve.\n\nSource: https://www.bi.no/forskning/business-review/articles/2021/1
 1/gi-norske-forbrukere-en-gronnere-black-friday/
